WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.583
Open Payments and find the invoice under Open balances. Carter Crafts owes thirty-three dollars.

00:05.583 --> 00:10.500
Choose Record Payment on that invoice. The form starts with its unpaid balance.

00:10.500 --> 00:15.250
For a five-dollar partial payment, enter five, check the date, and choose Cash.

00:15.250 --> 00:21.917
Review the invoice and amount. Confirm only when ready to post. This demonstration stops at confirmation.

